# This repository deliberately ships no large binaries and does not use Git LFS.
# The trained checkpoint is distributed via the Hugging Face Hub instead.
#
# `-filter` is what disables the LFS smudge/clean filters. Do not add `-diff` or
# `-merge` here: those make every file behave as binary, so `git diff` and code
# review show "Binary files differ" for ordinary source.
* -filter

*.py    text diff=python
*.md    text
*.yml   text
*.yaml  text
*.html  text
*.txt   text
*.cff   text
*.patch text
*.ipynb text

*.png binary
*.wav binary
